{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "00e332ef-3167-4274-a2fa-4086f53756f2",
    "name": "📌 Microsoft Foundry API (Azure OpenAI)",
    "description": "### About Microsoft Foundry\n\n\"Microsoft Foundry is an interoperable AI platform designed to amplify business impact while enabling organization-wide observability and control.\"\n\nMicrosoft builds its own models, such as Microsoft-Decision-1, and Foundry on Azure hosts models from other labs, such as OpenAI's GPT and Anthropic's Claude. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Cloud platforms**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Microsoft Foundry Account: [https://ai.azure.com/](https://ai.azure.com/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `microsoft_foundry_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:microsoft_foundry_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/latest](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/latest)\n    \n- Models: [https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/foundry-models/concepts/endpoints](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/foundry-models/concepts/endpoints)\n    \n- Decision API (Microsoft-Decision-1): [https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/foundry-models/how-to/use-foundry-models-microsoft-decision](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/foundry-models/how-to/use-foundry-models-microsoft-decision)\n\n### Notes\n\nSet `resource` to your Azure OpenAI / Foundry resource name and `deployment` to a model deployment name. The `/openai/v1/` route needs no `api-version`.\n\nThe **Decision** folder calls `Microsoft-Decision-1`, which returns typed decisions instead of text: `noul` (yes/no probability), `choice` (one option from a list) and `score` (a value on an ordered scale). Set `decisionDeployment` to its deployment name.\n\nThe **Messages (Anthropic)** folder calls Claude models deployed in Foundry through the Anthropic Messages API (`https://{resource}.services.ai.azure.com/anthropic/v1/messages`), which uses an `x-api-key` header and `anthropic-version`. Claude deployments don't support the Chat Completions or Responses routes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-11T21:25:54.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T23:53:38.000Z",
